{#
  The explicit "no email from any sender" request (catto-mail global opt-out).
  Shown only when the capability is enabled; never part of an ordinary unsubscribe.
#}
<div class="card border-danger-subtle mt-4 app-narrow ms-0" id="no-contact">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h2 class="h6"><i class="bi bi-slash-circle me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>Stop email from every sender using our mail service</h2>
    <p class="small mb-2">The unsubscribe options above only affect {{ site.listName }}. If you want <strong>no email at all from any sender</strong> that uses the same mail delivery service as we do, ask for it here. It also unsubscribes you from all our lists. You can withdraw it later on your profile page.</p>
    <form method="post" action="{{ path('global_optout') }}" data-confirm="Stop all email to you from every sender using this mail service?">
      <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ csrf_token('ctnlist') }}">
      <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" type="submit">Send me no email from any sender</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
